{"questions":[{"id":580587,"slug":"12265-193","question":"56412. Risk factors of conversion disorder include— (Conversion disorder-এর ঝুঁকির কারণগুলোর মধ্যে অন্তর্ভুক্ত—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Being female (নারী হওয়া )<br>","option2":"Perfectionism (উৎকৃষ্টতাবাদ/পরিপূর্ণতাবাদ)<br>","option3":"Abuse history (নির্যাতনের ইতিহাস)<br>","option4":"All (সবকটি)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>All are risk factors.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580586,"slug":"12265-192","question":"56411. Disorder with neurological-like symptoms but no organic cause = (স্নায়বিক লক্ষণযুক্ত কিন্তু কোনো জৈবিক/দেহযন্ত্রসংক্রান্ত কারণ নেই এমন ব্যাধিকে বলা হয়-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Conversion disorder (রূপান্তর ব্যাধি)<br>","option2":"Hypochondriasis (হাইপোকন্ড্রিয়াসিস)<br>","option3":"Schizophrenia (সিজোফ্রেনিয়া)<br>","option4":"Behavioral (আচরণগত ব্যাধি)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Conversion disorder mimics neurological illness.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580585,"slug":"12265-191","question":"56410. Dissociative disorders disrupt memory, consciousness, and— (বিচ্ছিন্নতাজনিত ব্যাধি (Dissociative disorders) স্মৃতি, চেতনা এবং— ব্যাহত করে।)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Identity (অভিন্নতা/পরিচয়)<br>","option2":"Forgetting (ভুলে যাওয়া)<br>","option3":"Motivation (প্রেরণা)<br>","option4":"Learning (শিক্ষণ)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Identity disturbance is core.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580584,"slug":"12265-190","question":"56409. Disorders with physical symptoms not fully explained medically = (চিকিৎসাগতভাবে পুরোপুরি ব্যাখ্যা করা যায় না এমন শারীরিক লক্ষণযুক্ত ব্যাধি হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Dissociative disorder<br>","option2":"Somatoform disorder<br>","option3":"Conversion disorder<br>","option4":"Panic<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>Somatoform = medically unexplained symptoms.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580583,"slug":"12265-189","question":"56408. Having relatives with OCD can … your risk. (OCD-এ আক্রান্ত আত্মীয় থাকলে আপনার ঝুঁকি ... )<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Raise (বাড়তে পারে)<br>","option2":"Decrease (কমতে পারে)<br>","option3":"Vary (পরিবর্তনশীল হতে পারে)<br>","option4":"Lessen (ক্ষুদ্রতর হতে পারে<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Genetics increase OCD risk.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580582,"slug":"12265-188","question":"56407. OCD fears &amp; behaviors can be learned via— (OCD-এর ভয় ও আচরণ কীভাবে শেখা যায়?)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Learning theory (শিক্ষণ তত্ত্বের মাধ্যমে)<br>","option2":"Biological theory (জৈবিক তত্ত্বের মাধ্যমে)<br>","option3":"Genetic theory (জিনগত তত্ত্বের মাধ্যমে)<br>","option4":"Behavioral theory (আচরণগত তত্ত্বের মাধ্যমে)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Learning explains OCD acquisition.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580581,"slug":"12265-187","question":"56406. Behaviors repeated to relieve anxiety = (উদ্বেগ কমাতে পুনরাবৃত্তিমূলক আচরণ হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Compulsion (বাধ্যবাধকতা)<br>","option2":"Obsession (আচ্ছন্নতা)<br>","option3":"Overthinking (অত্যধিক চিন্তা)<br>","option4":"None (কোনোটিই নয়)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Compulsions = repetitive anxiety-relieving acts.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580580,"slug":"12265-186","question":"56405. Fear of being trapped in inescapable place = (কোনো অপরিহার্য/অপরিহরণীয় স্থানে আটকে পড়ার ভয় হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Social phobia (সামাজিক ফোবিয়া)<br>","option2":"Agoraphobia (মুক্ত স্থানে আটকে পড়ার ভয়)<br>","option3":"Claustrophobia (ছোট বা সীমাবদ্ধ স্থানে আটকে পড়ার ভয়)<br>","option4":"Situational (পরিস্থিতিগত ফোবিয়া)<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>Agoraphobia = fear of open/inescapable spaces.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580579,"slug":"12265-185","question":"56404. Irrational, excessive fear of object/situation = (কোনো বস্তু বা পরিস্থিতির প্রতি অযৌক্তিক, অত্যধিক ভয় হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Pain (ব্যথা)<br>","option2":"Phobia (ফোবিয়া)<br>","option3":"Schizophrenia (সিজোফ্রেনিয়া)<br>","option4":"Anxiety (উদ্বেগ)<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>Phobia = excessive fear.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580578,"slug":"12265-184","question":"56403. Therapy making people aware of harmful thoughts = (যে চিকিৎসা পদ্ধতি মানুষকে তাদের ক্ষতিকর চিন্তাগুলো সম্পর্কে সচেতন করে-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Cognitive Behavior Therapy (জ্ঞানীয় আচরণগত থেরাপি)<br>","option2":"Psychotherapy (মানসিক চিকিৎসা)<br>","option3":"Medication (ঔষধ প্রয়োগ)<br>","option4":"Communication (যোগাযোগ)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>CBT challenges &amp; changes negative thoughts.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580577,"slug":"12265-183","question":"56402. People with GAD may— (GAD-এ আক্রান্ত ব্যক্তিরা—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Worry excessively (অতিরিক্ত দুশ্চিন্তা করে)<br>","option2":"Feel restless (অস্থির বোধ করে)<br>","option3":"Sweat a lot (অতিরিক্ত ঘামায়)<br>","option4":"All of them (উল্লিখিত সবগুলো)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>All symptoms are common in GAD.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580576,"slug":"12265-182","question":"56401. Persistent anxiety/dread interfering with life = (জীবনে ব্যাঘাত সৃষ্টিকারী স্থায়ী উদ্বেগ/ভয় হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Panic disorder (উদ্বেগজনিত মানসিক সমস্যা)<br>","option2":"Generalized anxiety disorder (GAD) (সর্বজনীন উদ্বেগজনিত ব্যাধি)<br>","option3":"Phobia (ফোবিয়া)<br>","option4":"Obsession (আচ্ছন্নতা)<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>GAD = persistent, uncontrollable worry.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580574,"slug":"12265-181","question":"56400. Therapy working with professional to explore causes = (এমন থেরাপি যেখানে একজন পেশাদারের (চিকিৎসক) সাথে কারণগুলো অনুসন্ধান করা হয় তা হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Psychotherapy (মানসিক চিকিৎসা)<br>","option2":"Medication (ঔষধ প্রয়োগ)<br>","option3":"Counselling (পরামর্শ সেবা)<br>","option4":"Modification (পরিবর্তন)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Psychotherapy = talking therapy.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580567,"slug":"12265-180","question":"56399. Anxiety disorders include— (উদ্বেগজনিত ব্যাধির (Anxiety disorders) মধ্যে অন্তর্ভুক্ত—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Panic disorder (প্যানিক ডিসঅর্ডার)<br>","option2":"OCD (অবসেসিভ-কম্পালসিভ ডিসঅর্ডার)<br>","option3":"Phobia (ফোবিয়া)<br>","option4":"All (সবগুলো)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>All are anxiety disorders.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580566,"slug":"12265-179","question":"56398. Interference with daily activities = (দৈনন্দিন ক্রিয়াকলাপে হস্তক্ষেপ হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Deviance (বিপথগামিতা)<br>","option2":"Distress (দুর্দশা)<br>","option3":"Dysfunction (বিপর্যয় বা অস্বাভাবিক প্রবণতা)<br>","option4":"Danger (বিপদ বা ঝুঁকি)<br>","option5":"","answer":3,"explain":"<p>Dysfunction disrupts daily life.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580565,"slug":"12265-178","question":"56397. Abnormal Psychology studies, assesses, treats, and … maladaptive behavior. (অস্বাভাবিক মনোবিজ্ঞান অসংগতিপূর্ণ (Maladaptive) আচরণ অধ্যয়ন, মূল্যায়ন, চিকিৎসা এবং ... করে।)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Cureity (নিরাময়)<br>","option2":"Prevention (প্রতিরোধ)<br>","option3":"Counselling (পরামর্শ)<br>","option4":"Medication (ঔষধ প্রয়োগ)<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>Includes prevention of disorders.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580564,"slug":"12265-177","question":"56396. Model emphasizing role of thoughts/beliefs in behavior =  (যে মডেল আচরণের ক্ষেত্রে চিন্তা/বিশ্বাসের ভূমিকার উপর জোর দেয়-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Biological (জৈবিক)<br>","option2":"Cognitive (জ্ঞানীয়)<br>","option3":"Behavioral (আচরণবাদী)<br>","option4":"Psychological (মনস্তাত্ত্বিক)<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>Cognitive model = thoughts shape behavior.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580563,"slug":"12265-176","question":"56395. Causes of abnormal behavior include— (অস্বাভাবিক আচরণের কারণের মধ্যে অন্তর্ভুক্ত—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Biological model (জৈবিক মডেল)<br>","option2":"Psychological model (মনস্তাত্ত্বিক মডেল)<br>","option3":"Socio-cultural model (সামাজিক-সাংস্কৃতিক মডেল)<br>","option4":"All of them (উল্লিখিত সবগুলো)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>Multi-causal.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580561,"slug":"12265-175","question":"56394. Causal factors of abnormal behavior include— (অস্বাভাবিক আচরণের কার্যকারণসম্বন্ধীয় (Causal) উপাদানের মধ্যে অন্তর্ভুক্ত—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Predisposing (পূর্বপ্রবণতাসৃষ্টিকারী)<br>","option2":"Precipitating (ত্বরান্বিতকারী)<br>","option3":"Maintaining (রক্ষণাবেক্ষণ)<br>","option4":"All of them (উল্লিখিত সবগুলো)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>All contribute to abnormality.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580560,"slug":"12265-174","question":"56393. State of well-being enabling coping, learning, working = (সুস্থতার এমন একটি অবস্থা যা মানুষকে মানিয়ে নেওয়া, শেখা ও কাজ করার সক্ষমতা দেয় তা হলো)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Mental health (মানসিক স্বাস্থ্য)<br>","option2":"Abnormal psychology (অস্বাভাবিক মনোবিজ্ঞান)<br>","option3":"Clinical psychology (ক্লিনিকাল মনোবিজ্ঞান)<br>","option4":"Psychology (মনোবিজ্ঞান)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>WHO defines mental health as well-being.</p>\r\n<p></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580559,"slug":"12265-173","question":"56392. Branch of medicine diagnosing &amp; treating mental disorders = (মানসিক ব্যাধি নির্ণয় ও চিকিৎসার সাথে সম্পর্কিত চিকিৎসাশাস্ত্রের শাখা-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Psychology (মনোবিজ্ঞান)<br>","option2":"Psychiatry (মনোরোগবিদ্যা)<br>","option3":"Clinical psychology (ক্লিনিকাল মনোবিজ্ঞান)<br>","option4":"Abnormal psychology (অস্বাভাবিক মনোবিজ্ঞান)<br>","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p>Psychiatry = medical branch for mental health.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580557,"slug":"12265-172","question":"56391. Abnormal behavior includes infrequency, violation, distress, dysfunction, and— (অস্বাভাবিক আচরণের মধ্যে অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয় বিরলতা, নিয়ম লঙ্ঘন, দুর্দশা, বিপর্যয় বা অস্বাভাবিক প্রবণতা এবং—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Unexpectedness (অপ্রত্যাশিততা)<br>","option2":"Expectedness (প্রত্যাশিততা)<br>","option3":"Normality (নৈয়মিকতা)<br>","option4":"Intelligence (বুদ্ধিমত্তা)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Unexpectedness is another criterion.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580556,"slug":"12265-171","question":"56390. To reduce cognitive dissonance, one must change attitude or— (জ্ঞানীয় দ্বন্দ্ব (Cognitive dissonance) কমাতে হলে, ব্যক্তিকে তার মনোভাব বা ...-এর পরিবর্তন করতে হবে।)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Morality (নৈতিকতা)<br>","option2":"Ethics (নীতিশাস্ত্র)<br>","option3":"Norms (নিয়ম)<br>","option4":"Actions (কর্ম)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>Dissonance reduced by changing actions or beliefs.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580554,"slug":"12265-170","question":"56389. Classical conditioning creates positive reactions by associating— (Classical conditioning ইতিবাচক প্রতিক্রিয়া সৃষ্টি করে কোনটির সাথে যুক্ত করে—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Positive feeling (ইতিবাচক অনুভূতি)<br>","option2":"Negative feeling (নেতিবাচক অনুভূতি)<br>","option3":"Undesired feeling (অপ্রত্যাশিত অনুভূতি)<br>","option4":"None of them (কোনোটি নয়)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Pairing with positive stimuli induces positive reactions.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580553,"slug":"12265-169","question":"56388. Attitudes are formed by— (মনোভাব গঠিত হয়—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Direct learning (প্রত্যক্ষ শিক্ষণের মাধ্যমে)<br>","option2":"Social learning (সামাজিক শিক্ষণের মাধ্যমে)<br>","option3":"Classical conditioning (শাস্ত্রীয় শর্তায়ন)<br>","option4":"All 