গোষ্ঠী)<br>","option3":"Leadership (নেতৃত্ব)<br>","option4":"Perception (ধারণা)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Attitude = evaluation of subject/object.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580503,"slug":"12265-147","question":"56366. Social institution transmitting moral values &amp; community standards = (যে সামাজিক প্রতিষ্ঠান নৈতিক মূল্যবোধ ও সামাজিক মানদণ্ড প্রচার করে তা হলো—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Government (সরকার)<br>","option2":"Education (শিক্ষা)<br>","option3":"Family (পরিবার)<br>","option4":"Religion (ধর্ম)<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p>Religion transmits values &amp; norms.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580502,"slug":"12265-146","question":"56365. First and most important agent of socialization = (সামাজিকীকরণের প্রথম এবং সবচেয়ে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ বাহক (Agent) হলো-)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Family (পরিবার)<br>","option2":"School (বিদ্যালয়)<br>","option3":"Peer group (সহকর্মী গোষ্ঠী)<br>","option4":"Teachers (শিক্ষকগণ)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Family = earliest socializing agent.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580500,"slug":"12265-145","question":"56364. Socialization that usually occurs in childhood via family &amp; education = (যে সামাজিকীকরণ সাধারণত শৈশবে পরিবার ও শিক্ষার মাধ্যমে ঘটে তাকে বলা হয়—)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"Primary socialization (প্রাথমিক সামাজিকীকরণ)<br>","option2":"Secondary socialization (গৌণ সামাজিকীকরণ)<br>","option3":"Morality (নৈতিকতা)<br>","option4":"Tertiary socialization (তৃতীয় পর্যায়ের সামাজিকীকরণ)<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Primary socialization = family + school.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":580499,"slug":"12265-144","question":"56363. Types of socialization? (সামাজিকীকরণের প্রকারভেদ কয়টি?)<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"2<br>","option2":"3<br>","option3":"4<br>","option4":"5<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Primary &amp; secondary socialization.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorit